Package: ChIPSP
Title: ChIP-SP Spatial Integration of ChIP-seq and Hi-C Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tianyi", "Zhou",
           email = "first.last@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    Integrates ChIP-seq peaks with Hi-C chromatin interaction data to identify
    spatially linked genomic regions. ChIP-SP maps ChIP-seq peaks to Hi-C loop
    anchors, projects regulatory signals to interacting genomic regions, and
    ranks spatially linked regions using ChIP-seq signal and Hi-C interaction
    confidence. The package also supports annotation of conventional ChIP-seq
    peaks and ChIP-SP regions for human and mouse reference genomes.
